  "title": "Versus",
  "description": "Read all Versus chapters here.\n\nA manga by ONE(Creator of One Punch Man & Mob Psycho)\nis set in a world where humanity has been losing a hopeless war against demons led by the Great Demon King and his 47 Demon Lords. \n\nIn a last attempt to survive, humans summon help from another world, only to discover that this world is also on the brink of destruction by its own overwhelming enemy. Soon it’s revealed that multiple worlds each with their own “natural enemy”...\n\nNow, all these powerful enemies coexist in a single world, far beyond humanity’s ability to defeat. Realising they cannot win through strength alone, humans shift their strategy: instead of fighting directly, they try to manipulate these unstoppable forces into fighting each other, hoping to survive in the chaos..\n",
